{"suttaId":"an10.168","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-x","vriCode":"s0404m3.mul","paras":[1238,1248],"vripara":"168"},"segments":{"an10.168:0.3":"Ariyapaccorohaṇīsuttaṃ","an10.168:1.1":"“Ariyaṃ vo, bhikkhave, paccorohaṇiṃ desessāmi.","an10.168:1.2":"Taṃ suṇātha, sādhukaṃ manasi karotha; bhāsissāmī”ti.","an10.168:1.3":"“Evaṃ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṃ.","an10.168:1.4":"Bhagavā etadavoca –","an10.168:2.1":"“Katamā ca, bhikkhave, ariyā paccorohaṇī?","an10.168:2.2":"Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako iti paṭisañcikkhati –","an10.168:2.3":"‘pāṇātipātassa kho pāpako vipāko –","an10.168:2.4":"diṭṭhe ceva dhamme abhisamparāyañcā’ti.","an10.168:2.5":"So iti paṭisaṅkhāya pāṇātipātaṃ pajahati;","an10.168:2.6":"pāṇātipātā paccorohati.","an10.168:3.1":"…‘Adinnādānassa kho pāpako vipāko –","an10.168:3.2":"diṭṭhe ceva dhamme abhisamparāyañcā’ti.","an10.168:3.3":"So iti paṭisaṅkhāya adinnādānaṃ pajahati;","an10.168:3.4":"adinnādānā paccorohati.","an10.168:4.1":"… ‘Kāmesumicchācārassa kho pāpako vipāko … pe …","an10.168:4.2":"kāmesumicchācārā paccorohati.","an10.168:5.1":"…‘Musāvādassa kho pāpako vipāko … pe …","an10.168:5.2":"musāvādā paccorohati.","an10.168:6.1":"…‘Pisuṇāya vācāya kho pāpako vipāko … pe …","an10.168:6.2":"pisuṇāya vācāya paccorohati.","an10.168:7.1":"…‘Pharusāya vācāya kho pāpako vipāko … pe …","an10.168:7.2":"pharusāya vācāya paccorohati.","an10.168:8.1":"…‘Samphappalāpassa kho pāpako vipāko … pe …","an10.168:8.2":"samphappalāpā paccorohati.","an10.168:9.1":"…‘Abhijjhāya kho pāpako vipāko … pe …","an10.168:9.2":"abhijjhāya paccorohati.","an10.168:10.1":"…‘Byāpādassa kho pāpako vipāko … pe …","an10.168:10.2":"byāpādā paccorohati.","an10.168:11.1":"‘micchādiṭṭhiyā kho pāpako vipāko diṭṭhe ceva dhamme abhisamparāyañcā’ti.","an10.168:11.2":"So iti paṭisaṅkhāya micchādiṭṭhiṃ pajahati;","an10.168:11.3":"micchādiṭṭhiyā paccorohati.","an10.168:11.4":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, ariyā paccorohaṇī”ti.","an10.168:11.5":"Dutiyaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":null,"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0404t.tik","from":765,"to":769,"paras":[{"para":765,"vripara":"167-210","refs":["an10.168:1"],"lines":["167-210. Dutiye ca paṭhamādīni uttānatthāni.","Dasame <b>pacchābhūmivāsino</b>ti paccantadesavāsino.","<b>Sevālamālikā</b>ti pātova udakaṃ orohitvā sevālañceva uppalādīni ca gahetvā attano udakasuddhikabhāvajānanatthañceva “lokassa ca udakena suddhi hotī”ti imassa atthassa jānanatthañca mālaṃ katvā pilandhanakā.","<b>Udakorohakā</b>ti pāto majjhanhe sāyanhe ca udakaorohaṇakā.","Tenāha <b>“sāyatatiyakaṃ udakorohaṇānuyogamanuyuttā”</b>ti.","Ekādasamādīni uttānatthāni.","Catutthe paṇṇāsake natthi vattabbaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["an10.168:1"],["an10.168:1"],["an10.168:1"],["an10.168:1"],["an10.168:1"],["an10.168:1"],["an10.168:1"]]},{"para":766,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.168:1"],"lines":["Brāhmaṇapaccorohaṇīsuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an10.168:1"]]},{"para":767,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.168:1"],"lines":["Catutthapaṇṇāsakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["an10.168:1"]]},{"para":768,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.168:1"],"lines":["(21)1. Karajakāyavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an10.168:1"]]},{"para":769,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.168:1"],"lines":["1-536. Paṭhamanirayasaggasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an10.168:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
